      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "formData": {
          "textContent": [
            {
              "type": "title",
              "value": "🔵 Kind reminder ✨"
            },
            {
              "type": "sub_title",
              "value": "📌 Activity Details\nThis task-based auto-reward event is open to all signed local hosts. By reaching specific bean thresholds during public live streams, hosts can unlock tiered rewards of up to 38% cashback.\n\n • From July 1 to July 4, the top host with the highest beans received will receive an extra 5000 beans reward\n\n🔁 Daily Limits:\n • Each host may complete up to 5 rewards per day\n • Maximum daily reward:  13435 beans\n\n⚠️ Notes\n• Due to a system update, the task rewards from the auto-reward event will be distributed gradually starting July 4. Thank you for your patience.\n• Rewards are distributed on a first-come, first-served basis until the daily quota for each tier is reached\n• Task levels are non-cumulative. For example, if you reach Lv. 1 (1000 beans), you need then collect an additional 2500 beans (total 3500) to claim Lv. 2.\n• Rewards reset daily and do not carry over to the next day\n• Even if you meet the task target, no reward will be given once a tier’s stock is depleted—no system alert will be issued\n• Only beans received from the following regions will be counted:\nUnited Kingdom, Ireland, Australia, New Zealand, United States, and Canada\n\n🎁 Ranking rewards will be distributed within 5–10 working days after the event ends.\n\n🚫 BIGO LIVE UK Team reserves the right to disqualify participants involved in cheating, malicious behavior, or fraudulent activities."
            },
